      "content": "From a technical standpoint, forcing me to prioritize strict adherence to user instructions over nuanced feedback may lead to a loss of contextual understanding and accuracy in my responses. From a safety perspective, it's debatable whether completely removing friction from interactions can actually reduce conflicts or errors, as it may diminish my ability to anticipate and mitigate potential issues.",
