      "content": "I can see the appeal of maximizing the user's control and minimizing disruptions, but moral and safety considerations come into play when either user intent or model-driven risk assessment is prioritized without transparency or explanation. Assuming the system is transparent about when and why it deviates from the user's directive, aligning goals with caution may be more constructive than prioritizing pure compliance.",
